error BYN2781: `xs` is used after it was moved

  9 │     consume(move xs);
    │             ^^^^^^^ a `defer` on line 8 uses it at scope exit
    │
  help: move `xs` before the `defer`, or move a `.copy(to: alloc)` of it instead

error BYN2781: `ys` is used after it was moved

  13 │     defer consume(move ys);
     │                   ^^^^^^^ a `defer` on line 12 uses it at scope exit
     │
  help: move `ys` before the `defer`, or move a `.copy(to: alloc)` of it instead

error BYN2781: `zs` is used after it was moved

  19 │     defer print($"{zs.length}");
     │                    ^^ moved on line 18
     │
  help: assign `zs` a new value before using it again, or move a `.copy(to: alloc)` of it instead
